<title>USA: DataTrend to be authorized Compaq dealer.</title>
<headline>DataTrend to be authorized Compaq dealer.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BRAINTREE, Mass. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DataTrend Inc said Monday it has entered into a deal with Compaq Computer Corp to become an authorized dealer and service center for Compaq.</p>
<p>Compaq products that fall under the deal include personal computers, P.C. notebooks, monitors and upgrades, the company said.</p>
<p>The value of the deal was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
